  "notes": "Adds preview click-to-edit: clicking titles, authors, tags, summaries/main text, notes, stats, interface controls, form fields, panels, headers, or required-tag icons opens the matching numbered editor panel and selects the relevant Text subgroup or required-tag row. Also makes Use Header automatically turn Fixed Background off and disable/grey that control until the header is turned off, preventing the fixed-background/header conflict."
